    <string name="whats_new_body">• Bug reports and suggestions can carry up to 3 screenshots or photos (EM-0016). They are made smaller and their location and other details are removed before sending.\n• New calendar and clock for picking the day and time, with Today, Tomorrow and Now shortcuts.
• Haptic feedback on taps and actions (can be turned off in Settings).
• Automatic bus positions ask for “Allow all the time” right away.
• Fixed: a new install showed the app in English although Slovenčina was selected.
• Emails from the developer now come from Plan&amp;Ride.</string>
